{"meta":{"id":"news-structure","category":"it/server/backend/express/features","title":"Express 클래스 구조 (뉴스 API)","subtitle":"","summary":"뉴스 API 호출을 클래스로 구성한 express 구조","tags":["express","node","class","news api","구조"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"blog: code/back/ExpressStructureNews.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-06-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>EXPRESS</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-06-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Express 클래스 구조 (뉴스 API)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 뉴스 API 호출을 클래스로 구성한 express 구조</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-800 font-semibold\">현재 상황</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">router - controller - manager - services(외부API , 내부DB)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">scheduler : 등록 시간마다 뉴스를 카테고리별로 크롤링 후 DB 저장</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">구조도</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">backEnd</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">express</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">router</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">controller</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">manager</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">manager</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">services_API</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">외부 API (뉴스)</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">manager</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">services_DB</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">내부 DB</span></span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">scheduler가 등록된 시간마다 카테고리별 뉴스를 크롤링해 DB에 저장합니다. (전체가 Server PC 안에서 동작)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/backend/express/features/news-structure","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"backend","title":"백엔드","path":"it/server/backend"},{"id":"express","title":"Express (Node.js)","path":"it/server/backend/express"},{"id":"features","title":"기능 구현","path":"it/server/backend/express/features"}],"hasImage":false}